  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Better Care Network (BCN) ODA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The global campaign aims to build consensus and commitment through endorsement of the Global Charter by a large coalition of actors and coordinating and convening these partners to support its implementation through sharing good practice and lessons learned on care reforms, leveraging efforts across countries and actors to enable sustained and transformative progress across a wide range of contexts and systems, resulting in significant progress and impact for children and their families.</narrative>
  </description>
